<title>SOUTH KOREA: POSCO resumes hot-rolled steel output.</title>
<headline>POSCO resumes hot-rolled steel output.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's largest steelmaker POSCO has resumed production in its hot-rolled steel plant after a five-day shutdown caused by a fire, a company official said on Tuesday.</p>
